Package: tenscuda-monitor
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TensCUDA contributors <https://github.com/jaxily/tenscuda>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: tenstorrent-dkms
Description: Live Tenstorrent card monitor for TensCUDA
 GNOME System Monitor–style live view of Tenstorrent Blackhole cards:
 temperature, power, AI clock, host memory, and TensCUDA decode speed
 when a workload is running.
 .
 Installs the TensCUDA Monitor desktop app and the uptens CLI.
 Card telemetry comes from sysfs; tok/s updates when TensCUDA is also
 installed and emitting activity events.
Homepage: https://github.com/jaxily/tenscuda
